    "location": "html-block:33",
    "text": "Overview",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:34",
    "text": "Our Bulletin 1766 MicroLogix™ 1400 Programmable Logic Controller Systems build upon critical MicroLogix 1100 features: EtherNet/IP™, on-line editing and a built-in LCD panel. These controllers feature a higher I/O count, faster high-speed counter, pulse train output, enhanced network capabilities and backlight on the LCD panel. Controllers without embedded analog I/O points provide 32 digital I/O points, while analog versions offer 32 digital I/O points and 6 analog I/O points. You can expand all versions with up to seven 1762 expansion I/O modules.",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:35",
    "text": "Ethernet port provides Web server capability, email capability and protocol support for DNP3 protocol support",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:36",
    "text": "Built-in LCD with backlight lets you view controller and I/O status",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:37",
    "text": "Built-in LCD provides simple interface for messages, bit/integer monitoring and manipulation",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:38",
    "text": "Expands application capabilities through support for as many as seven 1762 MicroLogix Expansion I/O modules with 256 discrete I/O",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:39",
    "text": "As many as six embedded 100 kHz high-speed counters (only on controllers with DC inputs)",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:40",
    "text": "Two serial ports with DF1, DH-485, Modbus RTU, DNP3, and ASCII protocol support",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:41",
    "text": "10 KB words in user program memory with 10 KB words in user data memory",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:42",
    "text": "Up to 128 KB for data logging and 64 KB for recipe",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:43",
    "text": "Programmed with RSLogix 500® software",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:44",
    "text": "Typical applications include:",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
